    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A licensed tie-in to the Blasto films, sold with the tagline \"Enkindle this.\" Under the garish casing is a perfectly serviceable incendiary scattergun: it sprays superheated shot from a battery-fed chamber and sets fire to most of what it hits. Serious operators file the logo off. Most of them keep the gun.</p><p><strong>Grades:</strong> This weapon rolls one more damage die at elite grade (a greater striking rune in Pathfinder) and a second at paragon grade (major striking).</p>"
